## Metadata
Title: A George Washington Cross-Word Puzzle
Copyright: New York World
Date: 1914-02-22
Number: 10
Notes: A 15-wide diamond with a diamond-shaped hole in the centre (shown as _) holding a portrait of Washington, for Washington's Birthday; nine clues are on Washington. The number is printed only in the intro ("the tenth in FUN'S series of cross-word puzzles"). No credit line is printed for the puzzle; the drawings round the grid are signed CALLAHAN. Read by hand from the Milwaukee Sentinel's page (Milwaukee_Sentinel_1914_02_22_80.png), solution from Milwaukee_Sentinel_1914_03_01_85.png, by Claude, 2026-11-16.
Numbering: apex-first


